# Code owner review is required only for these paths (.github/rulesets/main.json). Everything else merges on the
# required checks and codex-review alone. Risk paths: anything that writes hardware registers, touches calibration,
# signs, verifies or boots an update, or changes the pipeline that enforces all of this.

# Hardware register writes and the board model (FPGA, AFE, ADC, clocks, triggers, sequencer), including the
# unit-specific calibration (calfile, selfcal, coretrim), which cannot be regenerated.
